    "simulationVelocityFromPose": true,
    "notes": "Original-size ride-on mower CAD; source +Y up, +Z forward, -X left. Rear axle midpoint is base_link. Rear differential drive and two passive front caster forks, not Ackermann steering. Front fork and wheel assembly is neutralized from its source swivel angle and levelled to the rear tyre contact plane. Nominal masses and limits support simulation only; no manufacturer calibration, cutting forces, blade motion or grass removal is claimed. Colours are presentation choices, not manufacturer textures. Fixed sensor CAD reused from the existing garage; mounting bases supported by the hood. User-requested nominal Ackermann simulation conversion: rear drive, controlled front fork steering; original CAD caster geometry retained, not manufacturer calibration.",
